 the sequence converges to $0.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-dbf8a36f-7f35-538f-b598-e5154c361dd2"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-dbf8a36f-7f35-538f-b598-e5154c361dd2" :answer-field/id #uuid "dbf8a36f-7f35-538f-b598-e5154c361dd2" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-8435d0e8-40cd-5cd4-89d6-083368872674" :answer-field/choices ["answer-8435d0e8-40cd-5cd4-89d6-083368872674" "answer-56ac1be1-fce4-5b14-a773-c0df14c2a9b5" "answer-8f866f3c-7689-5311-b7e1-0b559c9e9370" "answer-6417f28a-8f7f-5ecc-be6c-7c8da2415e24" "answer-8301edff-e58a-593a-be70-3f68ef33e5f6"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-8435d0e8-40cd-5cd4-89d6-083368872674" :answer/id #uuid "8435d0e8-40cd-5cd4-89d6-083368872674" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "Converges to $0.$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-56ac1be1-fce4-5b14-a773-c0df14c2a9b5" :answer/id #uuid "56ac1be1-fce4-5b14-a773-c0df14c2a9b5" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "Converges to $2$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-8f866f3c-7689-5311-b7e1-0b559c9e9370" :answer/id #uuid "8f866f3c-7689-5311-b7e1-0b559c9e9370" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "Converges to $4$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-6417f28a-8f7f-5ecc-be6c-7c8da2415e24" :answer/id #uuid "6417f28a-8f7f-5ecc-be6c-7c8da2415e24" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "Converges to $\\frac{1}{2}$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-8301edff-e58a-593a-be70-3f68ef33e5f6" :answer/id #uuid "8301edff-e58a-593a-be70-3f68ef33e5f6" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "The sequence diverges" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-41a5c3bd-58e0-5924-89f4-127ab078d31e" :question/id #uuid "41a5c3bd-58e0-5924-89f4-127ab078d31e" :question/math-academy-id "q-141408" :question/problem "Does the sequence ${a}_{n}=2{(\\frac{2}{3})}^{n}$ for $n\\ge 1$ \nconverge or diverge? If it converges, what is its limit?" :question/worked-solution "Suppose we have a geometric sequence with the first term ${a}_{1}$ and common ratio $r.$ Then, we have the following convergence properties:\n\n- if $|r|<1,$ the sequence is convergent and converges to $0$\n\n- if $|r|>1,$ the sequence is divergent\n\nMoreover, we have the following edge cases:\n\n- if $r=1,$ the sequence is convergent and converges to ${a}_{1}$\n\n- if $r=-1,$ the sequence is divergent\n\nThe given sequence ${a}_{n}=2{(\\frac{2}{3})}^{n}$ is a geometric sequence with the common ratio $r=\\frac{2}{3}.$ \n\nSince $|r|<1,$ the sequence converges to $0.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-5521173e-4fd0-569c-b113-b91da149682d"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-5521173e-4fd0-569c-b113-b91da149682d" :answer-field/id #uuid "5521173e-4fd0-569c-b113-b91da149682d" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-22b7211e-dd6c-5a3e-88e8-d3edd2915633" :answer-field/choices ["answer-22b7211e-dd6c-5a3e-88e8-d3edd2915633" "answer-909b2006-2b10-5c79-9d1c-af317380a62c" "answer-6d1afbe3-f463-50af-b060-99529ce98d35" "answer-9c753113-557c-5b1c-8957-36be50789e48" "answer-1e72f358-8b3c-5fa0-a87f-b5c3e703b4d3"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-22b7211e-dd6c-5a3e-88e8-d3edd2915633" :answer/id #uuid "22b7211e-dd6c-5a3e-88e8-d3edd2915633" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "Converges to $0$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-909b2006-2b10-5c79-9d1c-af317380a62c" :answer/id #uuid "909b2006-2b10-5c79-9d1c-af317380a62c" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "Converges to $2$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-6d1afbe3-f463-50af-b060-99529ce98d35" :answer/id #uuid "6d1afbe3-f463-50af-b060-99529ce98d35" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "Converges to $\\frac{2}{3}$" :db/ens